{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "󱚉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "󱚉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "󱚉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "󱚉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "先雲居代云：總喫即不見有不足者。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "先雲居云：待某甲有口即道。長慶云：與麼\n則某甲謹退。雲居徵云：秪如雪峰與麼道，是入門語？不是入門語？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師參投子，機緣具如投子錄中。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師與欽山．巖頭自湘中入江南，至新吳之下，欽山濯足㵎側，見󳳲葉而喜曰：此山必有道人，可沿流尋之。師恚\n曰：你智眼大濁，佗日如何辨人？彼不惜福如此，住山何為哉？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "僧問\n疎山云：雪峰道：輕打我。意作麼生？山云：頭上插瓜虀，垂尾脚跟齊。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大王請師與玄沙入內論佛心印錄　妙德編"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此錄是內尚書三人同為王隔帳，後隨言錄之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自如疑是自知。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "保福問鵞湖：僧堂前且置，望州亭、烏石嶺什麼\n處相見？鵞湖驟步歸方丈，保福便入僧堂。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雪竇註云：國無二君。又云：知麼？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "風行草偃。又云：直與。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四顧匪絕。又云：看。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "獨露相倚。又云：險。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一西一東。又云：大難。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自南自北。又云：會也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "聞莫舉頭。又云：呵呵。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見應\n合眼。又云：撫掌。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "豈可徒然。又云：叶。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "事非草草。又云：\n苦。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去去誰同。又云：好住。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "須到如此。又云：努力。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "恩大難酬"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐祚至此，為梁所纂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
